    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer tile-matching game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is very simple. Players need to flip over two identical cards to eliminate them. Remembering the card patterns will help you complete the game faster. The game offers both single-player and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer mode, there are different game variations to choose from. For example, both players may have an identical deck arranged in the same order, racing to see who finishes first. Alternatively, players can compete on the same set of cards, with the winner determined by points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also practice in single-player mode to improve your speed and memory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer tile-matching game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is very simple. Players need to flip over two identical cards to eliminate them. Remembering the card patterns will help you complete the game faster. The game offers both single-player and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer mode, there are different game variations to choose from. For example, both players may have an identical deck arranged in the same order, racing to see who finishes first. Alternatively, players can compete on the same set of cards, with the winner determined by points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also practice in single-player mode to improve your speed and memory.</p>",
    "short_description": "A challenging matching game that requires quick reflexes and memory skills. It includes both single-player and multiplayer modes, with various difficulty levels and objectives to choose from in competitive play.",
